# Intent: The two small tools the dance needs. self.face.music_notes count 0 to 3 shows that many eighth notes floating up the sides of the face for 30 s (a new face decorator named notes, nine plain rounded rectangles; never over a mute, vision-off or quiet look or a ringing timer; count 0 ends only the notes). self.face.gaze x y ms looks to a place (x and y -100 to 100, 100 is 10 px, the widest the face zone allows) and returns to the middle after ms.
# Placement: unit
# Upstream: firmware/main/hal/maipai_decor.cc, maipai_decor_core.h (ours)
# Check after a flash: self.face.music_notes count 3 shows three notes drifting up beside the eyes and fading; count 0 clears them; self.face.gaze x 100 y 0 ms 1500 moves both eyes to the right and back.
# Kconfig: CONFIG_MAIPAI_FACE_DECOR (existing)

